            <ArticleTitle>Osteitis in a torus mandibularis secondary to trauma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>74-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case is reported of osteitis in a mandibular torus subsequent to trauma, and the literature is reviewed. Excision of a torus mandibularis is recommended once osteitis develops.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
